0,Bundeli language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bundeli_language,Bundeli (Devanagari: बुन्देली/बुंदेली) or Bundelkhandi is an Indo-Aryan language spoken in the Bundelkhand region of central India. It belongs to the Central Indo-Aryan languages and is part of the Western Hindi subgroup.,Bundeli,Indo-European
